+/*
+ * phone-app-exec-count.patch. One more at every exec of an app or extension bundle, what the CPU governor's launch boost starts on
+ * (PaganiArmCpu CpuFreqGovernor.h). launchd spawns apps and extensions itself and daemons through xpcproxy, and both come here, so the
